  diseaseId: gastritis
  diseaseName: "GASTR\u0130T"
  generalInfo: "Gastrit, mide mukozas\u0131n\u0131n iltihaplanmas\u0131yla geli\u015Fen
    bir sindirim sistemi hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda mide b\xF6lgesinde
    a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, mide b\xF6lgesinde yanma ve bulant\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "\xDCst mide b\xF6lgesinde a\u011Fr\u0131 var olmas\u0131, bulant\u0131
    var olmas\u0131, mide b\xF6lgesinde yanma var olmas\u0131 ve yemeklerden sonra
    a\u011Fr\u0131 art\u0131yor olmas\u0131 gastritte s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir.
    Baz\u0131 hastalarda ara s\u0131ra hafif ek\u015Fi su geliyor olabilir."
